    "updated_at": "2023-02-16T13:48:29Z",
    "body": "AFAIU \"spin the event loop\" is like an async/await and always posts a task when it's done to continue. It means that currently the spec actually separates the deferred scripts by one per task, but the implementations do not. @domenic maybe has some historical context for this?",
