    "created_at": "2023-02-23T06:50:00Z",
    "updated_at": "2023-02-23T06:50:00Z",
    "body": "> there are many websites that depend on this kind of Chromium's sync behavior despite not spec conformant\r\n\r\nI'm not sure websites can rely on the sync behaviour since the grouping in one long task is dependant on a race condition.",
