    "body": "> The spec matches what is implemented as described here [...]\r\n> ...\r\n> Defer scripts are run during \"[the end](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#the-end)\" which runs spin the event loop between each defer/module script. So setTimeout(fn, 0) ought to run between such scripts\r\n\r\nI'm confused. You're saying the spec would run setTimeout() in between defer scripts, but isn't the OP about the implementation _not_ doing that, i.e., they run in the _same_ task? Doesn't that mean the spec does _not_ match what is implemented?",
