    "body": "Hmm, reading the algorithm for spin the event loop again I think I had the wrong idea of how it works. Indeed it doesn't have a loop to run tasks and check _goal_, it just waits in parallel until _goal_ is met. So the normal event loop processing must happen in the meantime. Apologies for the confusion.",
